  "interpretation": "The separate observer received 1,487 left and 1,486 right frames, with no source-stamp gap above 300 ms and no left_stale status. Localization entered TRACKING, remained valid for about 41 seconds, and then locked on normalized_cost_exceeded. This supports that the sensor source can remain fresh in the reduced-load setup; it does not establish why the full #256 stack hit left_stale, because the observer cannot prove per-message adapter receipt and the workload differs.",
